{"id":"n64127-1-7","stage":1,"title":"소화제 · 消化药","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64127-1-7-1","ko":"점심을 먹고 나서부터 계속 속이 더부룩하네.","zh":"吃完午饭后，我的肚子就一直胀胀的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심을","audio":"/audio/995779c1209c18f09c54.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"나서부터","meaning":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","explanation":"나다：做完前面的动作（-고 나다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서부터","audio":"/audio/d63df48a030dbc93b0d3.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"속이","meaning":"内脏，心口，肚子","explanation":"속：内脏，心口，肚子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"3","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속이","audio":"/audio/6f6688764f24b1ca69ac.mp3"}},{"text":"더부룩하네.","meaning":"胃胀","explanation":"더부룩하다：胃胀；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"더부룩하다","audio":"/audio/72a9a25f5b4daae82528.mp3"}],"